{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Shall I conceal from Avraham.</b> The Holy One, blessed be He, spoke at length in praise of Avraham, yet Avraham's heart was not lifted up on this account; rather, he humbled himself and said, ״ואנכי עפר ואפר״ — 'and I am dust and ashes.' From this it is fitting to learn that anyone who is praised should not grow proud on that account, but should humble himself even more than he already was."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:13:22.941912494Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}